  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Right2Grow</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Right to Grow &#x2013; Power of Voices partnership which aims to set the basis for all children under 5 to be well-nourished and thereby able to reach their full potential. Max Foundation Bangladesh is the Bangladesh country lead in the Right to Grow partnership and besides the consortium coordination Max Foundation will, together with local partners, strengthen CSO&#x2019;s capacity in their grassroots advocacy efforts towards ensuring that the voices and needs of especially children under 5 are heard. Activities will include facilitation, capacity building and technical support to the actors in WASH, nutrition, and primary healthcare in communities.</narrative>
  </description>
